{"id":"n85690-1-10","stage":3,"title":"해설 · 解说","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n85690-1-10-1","ko":"이 문제는 해설을 봐도 잘 모르겠어요.","zh":"这道题就算看了讲解也还是不太明白。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"문제는","meaning":"题，问题","explanation":"문제：题，问题；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"문제","audio":"/audio/bc0fca46ae9a48794dbd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66246","senseId":"1","lemma":"문제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"문제는","audio":"/audio/be63aa4f8e571c21ded3.mp3"}},{"text":"해설을","meaning":"解说，讲解","explanation":"해설：解说，讲解；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"해설","audio":"/audio/608c5fe57a7726bec6be.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"85690","senseId":"1","lemma":"해설","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해설을","audio":"/audio/c29cbde95f0eda750b0c.mp3"}},{"text":"봐도","meaning":"阅读，看","explanation":"보다：阅读，看；어도：表示让步：“即使、就算”；-아/어도 되다 表示“可以”。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"3","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봐도","audio":"/audio/fdd01bd86a193dbd13e5.mp3"}},{"text":"잘","meaning":"好好地，顺利地","explanation":"잘：好好地，顺利地","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"4","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}},{"text":"모르겠어요.","meaning":"不知道，不认识，不懂","explanation":"모르다：不知道，不认识，不懂；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"모르다","audio":"/audio/20ef19694f337fd42539.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29712","senseId":"1","l